{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "eurocomply-webhooks",
    "name": "EuroComply Webhooks",
    "description": "Simulated Clerk webhook events for local testing.\n\nNote: These only work if the API is running with `skipSignatureVerification: true` in test mode.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "clerkOrgId",
      "value": "org_test123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "clerkUserId",
      "value": "user_test123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "clerkUserId2",
      "value": "user_test456",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Organization Webhooks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. organization.created",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-id",
                "value": "msg_org_created_{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-timestamp",
                "value": "{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-signature",
                "value": "v1,test"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"organization.created\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{clerkOrgId}}\",\n    \"name\": \"Test Organization\",\n    \"slug\": \"test-organization\",\n    \"created_at\": {{$timestamp}}\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/clerk",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "clerk"]
            },
            "description": "Creates an organization record and provisions the tenant schema.\n\n**Expected Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"organizationId\": \"org_xxx\",\n  \"schemaName\": \"tenant_org_test123\"\n}\n```\n\n**Idempotent:** Sending again returns existing org."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. organization.deleted",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-id",
                "value": "msg_org_deleted_{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-timestamp",
                "value": "{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-signature",
                "value": "v1,test"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"organization.deleted\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{clerkOrgId}}\",\n    \"name\": \"Test Organization\",\n    \"slug\": \"test-organization\",\n    \"created_at\": {{$timestamp}}\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/clerk",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "clerk"]
            },
            "description": "Drops the tenant schema and deletes the organization record.\n\n**Expected Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"organizationId\": \"org_xxx\",\n  \"schemaName\": \"tenant_org_test123\"\n}\n```\n\n**Idempotent:** If org doesn't exist, returns success."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Organization lifecycle webhooks from Clerk."
    },
    {
      "name": "Membership Webhooks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. organizationMembership.created (First User)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-id",
                "value": "msg_mem_created_{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-timestamp",
                "value": "{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-signature",
                "value": "v1,test"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"organizationMembership.created\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"mem_first_{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"organization\": {\n      \"id\": \"{{clerkOrgId}}\"\n    },\n    \"public_user_data\": {\n      \"user_id\": \"{{clerkUserId}}\",\n      \"identifier\": \"admin@example.com\",\n      \"first_name\": \"Admin\",\n      \"last_name\": \"User\",\n      \"image_url\": \"https://example.com/avatar.png\"\n    },\n    \"role\": \"org:admin\",\n    \"created_at\": {{$timestamp}}\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/clerk",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "clerk"]
            },
            "description": "Adds the first user to an organization.\n\n**First user gets:**\n- `isOrgAdmin: true`\n- All workspace authorities: `MANAGER`\n\n**Expected Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"created\",\n  \"userId\": \"usr_xxx\"\n}\n```\n\n**Idempotent:** Sending again returns:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"already_exists\",\n  \"userId\": \"usr_xxx\"\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. organizationMembership.created (Second User)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-id",
                "value": "msg_mem_created2_{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-timestamp",
                "value": "{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-signature",
                "value": "v1,test"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"organizationMembership.created\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"mem_second_{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"organization\": {\n      \"id\": \"{{clerkOrgId}}\"\n    },\n    \"public_user_data\": {\n      \"user_id\": \"{{clerkUserId2}}\",\n      \"identifier\": \"member@example.com\",\n      \"first_name\": \"Regular\",\n      \"last_name\": \"Member\",\n      \"image_url\": null\n    },\n    \"role\": \"org:member\",\n    \"created_at\": {{$timestamp}}\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/clerk",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "clerk"]
            },
            "description": "Adds a subsequent user to an organization.\n\n**Subsequent users get:**\n- `isOrgAdmin: false` (unless role is `org:admin`)\n- All workspace authorities: `NONE`\n\n**Expected Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"created\",\n  \"userId\": \"usr_xxx\"\n}\n```\n\nThis user will get 403 Forbidden when accessing protected routes until an admin grants them workspace access."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. organizationMembership.deleted",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-id",
                "value": "msg_mem_deleted_{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-timestamp",
                "value": "{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-signature",
                "value": "v1,test"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"organizationMembership.deleted\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"mem_deleted_{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"organization\": {\n      \"id\": \"{{clerkOrgId}}\"\n    },\n    \"public_user_data\": {\n      \"user_id\": \"{{clerkUserId2}}\",\n      \"identifier\": \"member@example.com\",\n      \"first_name\": \"Regular\",\n      \"last_name\": \"Member\",\n      \"image_url\": null\n    },\n    \"role\": \"org:member\",\n    \"created_at\": {{$timestamp}}\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/clerk",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "clerk"]
            },
            "description": "Removes a user from an organization (soft delete).\n\n**Expected Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"soft_deleted\"\n}\n```\n\n**User not found:**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"user_not_found\"\n}\n```\n\n**Org not found:**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"org_not_found\"\n}\n```\n\nThe user record is preserved with `deleted_at` set for audit trail."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. user.updated",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-id",
                "value": "msg_user_updated_{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-timestamp",
                "value": "{{$timestamp}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "svix-signature",
                "value": "v1,test"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"user.updated\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{clerkUserId}}\",\n    \"email_addresses\": [\n      {\n        \"email_address\": \"newemail@example.com\",\n        \"id\": \"email_123\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"primary_email_address_id\": \"email_123\",\n    \"first_name\": \"Updated\",\n    \"last_name\": \"Name\",\n    \"image_url\": \"https://example.com/new-avatar.png\",\n    \"organization_memberships\": [\n      {\n        \"organization\": {\n          \"id\": \"{{clerkOrgId}}\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhooks/clerk",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhooks", "clerk"]
            },
            "description": "Updates user profile information across all their organizations.\n\n**Expected Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"queued\",\n  \"count\": 1\n}\n```\n\nThis creates outbox events for async processing. A worker will update the user's profile in each tenant schema.\n\n**Note:** `count` equals the number of organizations the user belongs to."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "User membership webhooks from Clerk.\n\n**Execution Order:**\n1. First run `organization.created` to provision the tenant\n2. Then run `organizationMembership.created (First User)` - gets MANAGER\n3. Optionally run `organizationMembership.created (Second User)` - gets NONE\n4. Test `user.updated` to sync profile changes\n5. Test `organizationMembership.deleted` to remove user"
    }
  ]
}
